  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi Donor Trust Fund for Bangladesh Climate Change Resilience Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Bangladesh MDTF for climate change is to support  the implementation of the country&apos;s climate change strategy and action  plan (CCSAP). The CCSAP aims to: (i) increase the country&apos;s resilience  to climate change; (ii) reduce the risks posed by climate change to  national development; and (iii) ensure rapid economic development  while maintaining a low carbon growth path.</narrative>
  </description>
